Phone detection is not a copy of python-phonenumbers or libphonenumber.
Presidio calls that library; this package uses its own patterns for the
same kind of written phone number, with Presidio's context words and base score.

US street addresses, legal identifiers (case, docket, Bates, matter, and
judge or party cues), known-party lists, placeholders, restore, and the
fail-safe pass are original to Isolated Sources.
